<title>UK: Eiffage sets 1 bln Ffr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Eiffage sets 1 bln Ffr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EIFFAGE</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    01.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE    CONVERTIBLE  ISS PRICE  280.0 FFR PAY DATE    22.NOV.96</p>
<p>CNV PERIOD 22.NOV.96-01.JAN.02</p>
<p> NOTES	HOLDERS WILL BE ENTITLED TO 1.12 SHARES PER BOND IF</p>
<p>		CONVERTING BEFORE 31.DEC.96 AND ONE SHARE PER BOND</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	     REDEMPTION AT 308.50 FFR</p>
<p>		PRIORITY SUBSCRIPTION PERIOD FOR EXISTING SHARE</p>
<p>		HOLDERS06.NOV.96-15.NOV.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
